            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Surat Thani",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Surat Thani",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Surat’s downtown accommodation comes almost exclusively in the form of mid-size hotels offering solid value in the budget to flashpacker range. Surprising for a city with such a prime place on the tourism map, there are no good backpacker-oriented guesthouses or hostels in town at research time in late 2015.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "If you have your own wheels and need a place to sleep before a morning ferry ride to the islands, consider skipping the city and staying at a seaside resort closer to the piers in Don Sak; we’ve heard that Lam-Tong Resort and Wanghin Bungalows are reasonable choices in the 500 to 1,000 baht range.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "CBD Hotel",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Surat Thani",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "We’re not so sure that this area constitutes a “central business district,” but nevertheless the CBD Hotel enjoys an excellent location in the heart of Surat Thani. The fairly large flashpacker-style hotel delivers good value on spacious rooms with plenty of in-room amenities. Accessed by a lift from a glossy lobby, the cheapest rooms come with soft beds, lots of space and nearly... Read our full review of CBD Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7447",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7447",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of CBD Hotel including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "CBD Hotel",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7447",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7447",
                "anchor_text": "CBD Hotel"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "My Place @ Surat Hotel",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Surat Thani",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Located a stone’s throw from Surat Thani riverfront and night market, the 55-room My Place @ Surat Hotel is a backpacker favourite with clean, reasonably priced rooms and friendly service. Look no further if you’re on a tight budget—rooms come in a few different styles that will satisfy bare-bones budget travellers and backpackers who can afford to spend a bit more for creature... Read our full review of My Place @ Surat Hotel including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7448",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7448",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of My Place @ Surat Hotel including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "My Place @ Surat Hotel",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7448",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7448",
                "anchor_text": "My Place @ Surat Hotel"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Papangkorn House",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Surat Thani",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Papangkorn House is more of a serviced apartment style hotel that’s especially well suited to light sleepers, thanks to the quiet location down a residential side street in Surat Thani.\nThough a bit further from the riverfront than My Place or the CBD Hotel, the Papangkorn is only a 10-minute walk from the downtown bus stations and night market. A personable owner and spotless rooms sweeten... Read our full review of Papangkorn House including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7449",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7449",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Papangkorn House including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Papangkorn House",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7449",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7449",
                "anchor_text": "Papangkorn House"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "table_content": null
      },
      {
        "h_title": "Sabye d Resort",
        "main_title": "Where to stay in Surat Thani",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 3,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Stroll across the bridge from the City Pillar Shrine in downtown Surat Thani and you’ll find the Sabye d Resort, offering some of the best-value rooms that we saw in Surat, delivering a relaxing atmosphere on the north side of the Tapi River. Fronted by a large sign and tiny office behind a few noodle stalls, the Sabye d doesn’t look like much from the road. Head further back down a... Read our full review of Sabye d Resort including room rates and direct contact details.",
            "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7450",
            "urls": [
              {
                "url": "https://www.travelfish.org/accommodation_profile/thailand/southern_thailand/surat_thani/surat_thani/all/7450",
                "anchor_text": "... Read our full review of Sabye d Resort including room rates and direct contact details."
              }
            ]
          }
